{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109452","id":2732390029,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6i3PaN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109452","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109452.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109452.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109452","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109452/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109452/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109452/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b66c23ba06323571c49d3b322e1548e1acee6e66","number":109452,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix `AudioStreamPlayer3D` `volume_db` not actually changing volume","user":{"login":"RoyBerardo","id":32561682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTYxNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32561682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo","html_url":"https://github.com/RoyBerardo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109423\r\n\r\nIt seems that `AudioStreamPlayer3D` `volume_db` was being applied in the attenuation function, seemingly shifting the attenuation distance. The attenuation has a volume cap, and is often at that cap. Lowering `volume_db` gave the effect of moving the listener away, which in some cases would lower volume once the volume is low enough or distance far enough where the volume is no longer capped. This would also had an effect where lowering volume would apply attenuation filtering effects. This PR moves `volume_db` out of the attenuation function and applies it only as a volume vector multiplier.\r\n\r\nThis does not interpolate the value of volume_db over time, so I was worried that there would be clicks and pops. However, I didn't notice any, even when doing sudden dramatic volume shifts on low frequency sounds. I believe something is interpolating the value. I went looking for whatever that was but got quite lost in the weeds, so I decided that it was probably fine.\r\n\r\n~~This is a small change with huge consequences that will definitely break compat. Any projects using `AudioStreamPlayer3D` instances that touched `volume_db` will definitely feel the difference.~~ Thanks to [Calinou](https://github.com/Calinou)'s suggestion, this is a project setting that defaults to false but is enabled on newly-made projects, therefore not breaking compat.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-09T06:20:54Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T12:21:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assi